# Maintainer-only agent addendum (template)

Copy to **`AGENTS.local.md`** next to `AGENTS.md` (git-ignored).

- Read **AGENTS.md** first, then **AGENTS.local.md** when present.
- Optional git-ignored private planning tree under `main/` for backlog, plans, and stories.
- Entry navigation: doc index and local backlog board (paths live in your populated addendum).
- Worktree bootstrap: symlink private planning material and optionally `AGENTS.local.md` from `../main/`.
- Workflow scripts (`podman-work/scripts/`, not in public git): document in your addendum; **human-first** — agent gives you the `../scripts/...` command for gate/merge/bootstrap unless you insist the agent run it.
- Cursor: one canonical `podman-work/.cursor/`; run `../scripts/link-shared-cursor.sh` from each worktree root so `.cursor` points at `../.cursor`.
- Never link private planning material in Jira or public docs.

Maintain the real addendum on your machine; copy from backup or recreate from your private planning README if needed.
